+  "Blocks on a counted page (property value blocks included, as they sit on their owner's page)
+  that aren't in `private`: one pass over the :block/page datoms, with no entity reads."
+  [db page-ids private]
+  (reduce (fn [n datom]
+            (if (and (contains? page-ids (:v datom)) (not (contains? private (:e datom))))
